      "isAutoRefreshDisabled": false,
      "markdown": "**Traffic**\n\nRequest count and 2xx success count per endpoint (`POST /issue` and `POST /revoke`) on the `crs-backend-status-api` API Gateway. 2xx is calculated as total count minus 4xx and 5xx errors."
    },
    {
      "name": "Markdown",
      "tileType": "MARKDOWN",
      "configured": true,
      "bounds": {
        "top": 722,
        "left": 1368,
        "width": 456,
        "height": 152
      },
      "tileFilter": {},
      "isAutoRefreshDisabled": false,
      "markdown": "**Latency**\n\nAverage (yellow) and maximum (blue) latency (ms) per endpoint shown on a single chart, plotted against our latency SLOs. Threshold lines: yellow at 1000ms (PERF001 \u2014 p95 \u2264 1s) and red at 2500ms (PERF002 \u2014 p99 \u2264 2.5s).\n\nNote: These SLOs are percentile targets (p95/p99), but Dynatrace does not support percentile metrics for API Gateway \u2014 avg and max are used as substitutes. Treat the lines as SLO reference points rather than exact p95/p99 measurements: avg will tend to sit below the true p95, while max represents absolute worst-case (single slowest request) and will breach the lines more readily than p99 would."
    },
