      },
      "tileFilter": {},
      "isAutoRefreshDisabled": false,
      "markdown": "**Errors**\n\n4xx (client) and 5xx (server) error counts per endpoint. 4xx errors typically indicate bad requests or auth failures. 5xx errors indicate server-side issues requiring investigation."
    },
