      "tileFilter": {},
      "isAutoRefreshDisabled": false,
      "markdown": "**Saturation**\n\nThrottle rate % = TPS / rate limit (1000 req/s) \u00d7 100. Burst rate % = TPS / burst limit (1200 req/s) \u00d7 100. Limits are the `crs-backend-status-api` StatusApigw values for build/integration/staging. These are API-level (shared across both endpoints). Uses `:rate(1s)` to convert to requests/second. Threshold lines: yellow at 50%, red at 80% (consistent with Lambda concurrency thresholds)."
